                            "text": "He used a dirty old <w>clout</w> to wipe the grease from his tools.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "他用一块脏旧的<w>抹布</w>擦掉了工具上的油污。"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The beggar wrapped his feet in ragged <w>clouts</w> to protect them from the winter cold.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "乞丐用破烂的<w>碎布</w>包裹双脚，以抵御冬日的严寒。"
                            }
